#: ../../source/docs/common-3d-mapping.rst:27 03c6f17a26c940738bc2da6f735c9e9d
#: 31d175a2894f41d89f4556790c959ecb 5ac40aa7aa824ac984c9b69dbdb622a6
#: e3c4150598f24aa0a5d3df91ea0729d9 fa18aee79d9b4e6480eea669849991c6
msgid ""
"A digital still camera  with some method of triggering the camera shutter"
msgstr "一台可触发快门的数字静态相机"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3d-mapping.rst:29 148a664b0f3646d88764af6d1390cb21
#: 2b9ec458554649ff8af7d77fb31cdb78 33da1ea59762478fbde3bbbb34db2cc0
#: 75b87577bc264e9180f38b1eb7786d3b aa42d2ecd12a495e994deb5cbcf9b90f
msgid "GoPro cameras are not recommended because of their fish-eye lenses"
msgstr "不推荐使用 GoPro 相机，因为其使用鱼眼镜头"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3d-mapping.rst:31 0918b5824e6840bea7978159597e367c
#: 0c9e570f7a2c442cacbc5f856f419627 8fcb0a0e11ef406ca294531fdbbff041
#: aa2c2ac34b354653abb465a5bf91456e e6eef6ca6d8d4997ae6950764d75c362
msgid ""
"A downward facing :ref:`gimbal <common-cameras-and-gimbals>` or hard mount "
"to attach a camera to the vehicle."
msgstr "一个向下的 :ref:`云台 <common-cameras-and-gimbals>` 或固定安装支架，用于将相机固定在飞行器上"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3d-mapping.rst:35 328219f39ef84d12b2702ef6c2b845d9
#: 70d757c631e149108b59700ce85597b9 9da0f189efd54fe383a46eb40b4bdeaa
#: db2214a755ae4e038bd192dde4579da7 f4f81cb0fff848dd91d871e632a92dda
msgid "Sample Mission"
msgstr "示例任务"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3d-mapping.rst:40 04bc85b692b84661983663e5b0931c06
#: 1d8980b7235f4c9cb3dd4c85cac8c26e 62eec977cae94440a5a38a3a5b9a50c0
#: 8de2396d48c14d98831f522b8563a202 c1602a6e7efb477eb6ebb4ead7afda4d
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"A good 3d rendering can be accomplished with 60 ~ 100 still pictures. There "
"should be at least 65% overlap between consecutive pictures but aiming for "
"80% or even higher is recommended.  The aerial photographs can also be "
"combined with photos taken from the ground."
msgstr ""
"良好的 3D 渲染效果通常需要 60～100 张静态图片，相邻图片之间至少应有 65% 的重叠，推荐达到 80% "
"甚至更高。空中照片还可与地面拍摄的照片结合使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3d-mapping.rst:45 1c2bd3229fca44d8bf79c61b0dabeb92
#: 5b9b8c4d74c641b59dd68fd46f3c75b5 b070b7567be84f7c855cc667b6ce8187
#: d48ff209876442489d6f9784b011dde6 da198dc54b984b9d86aa6b20eb647716
msgid ""
"The altitude of the mission depends upon the subject.  For large flat areas,"
" flying 40m ~ 80m above the surface should provide very detailed images (and"
" thus a detailed final product) but for buildings flying higher (i.e. 100m "
"above the building) reduces distortion."
msgstr ""
"任务飞行高度取决于拍摄对象。对于大面积平坦地区，在地表上方 40～80m "
"飞行可获取非常详细的图像（从而得到高质量成品）；对于建筑物，在较高高度（即建筑物上方 100m）飞行可减少畸变。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3d-mapping.rst:50 0474a97b1a704188aeebbb1141c871ce
#: 1abc045bb1c04823acf32cc2442eee41 3125be49e9804c19b816cc46ebb270cf
#: 3f2e703d708e49b7ac8f4a63bf9bb229 d4305a2691794a9fb15b987f5f319b08
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"It is recommended to fly a mission that is made up of parallel tracks with "
"each track between 25m and 100m apart.  The higher the vehicle, the wider "
"apart the tracks can be.  In general you should aim for 65% overlap in "
"pictures from adjacent tracks."
msgstr ""
"建议规划由平行航线组成的任务，相邻航线间距 25～100m。飞行高度越高，航线间距可以越大。通常应确保相邻航线拍摄的图片有 65% 的重叠。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3d-mapping.rst:55 2db189d228ad471c91c3e216f544eaf7
#: 373fe0205b0d4f74828338c6092d104b 777c5322bbc7426db47bbd1ab866ece8
#: dc3174d38bd843d8a69417ec56f1419b e05969af11f746bdb75a5276989b2a8f
msgid ""
"The camera shutter needs to be triggered throughout the mission (i.e every 2"
" to 5 seconds or at regular distance intervals).  Many cameras include a "
"feature to take pictures at regular time intervals. If not, then a camera "
"shutter release method must be implemented via a relay control, see "
":ref:`common-camera-shutter-with-servo` for example."
msgstr ""
"在整个任务过程中需要持续触发相机快门（即每隔 2～5 "
"秒或按固定距离间隔触发）。许多相机内置定时拍摄功能；若没有，则需通过继电器控制实现快门触发，例如参见 :ref:`common-camera-"
"shutter-with-servo`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3d-mapping.rst:60 969c036271864637bf6048c04e9ae8f7
#: 9e25601b778547f69f6263d4b47ad840 9e8bc0a4f0bc4cbfb1b47dcc6507743e
#: ac7365f5e39a4f09954e8c215fd7b702 aefb1cba27574babb4b7ad239d2c0f29
msgid ""
"A mission to accomplish this would include some or all of these commands:"
msgstr "实现上述目标的任务应包含以下部分或全部指令："

#: ../../source/docs/common-3d-mapping.rst:63 2469f9af3dfc462483e4d3dcac00b8eb
#: 3030f11b68834e38bacf25ff1e72243a 66c969cce1b24ea0bcba432f56c2d7ed
#: 82f0dec6ebd4405d847c0289c5e36073 a754d367910842778ebdb374c5da0bef
msgid ""
"**TAKEOFF** - will cause the vehicle to climb straight to the target "
"altitude provided in the \"Alt\" column (normally in meters)"
msgstr "**TAKEOFF** - 使飞行器垂直爬升至「Alt」列中指定的目标高度（通常以米为单位）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3d-mapping.rst:66 2d1f7ed754884db08b8a0766f82341d6
#: 565716ff95604e7d88cb6f339facfa3a 587a7c5f3e954680bfde6a65acb176e7
#: 6b3717d6c9c3412ebdd3d1f938962bee 7a4989c541554323a9634dc15aa6c3e1
msgid ""
"**WAYPOINT** - provide as many waypoints as required to fly over the scene "
"in a grid pattern.  Altitude should be entered in the \"Alt\" column.  "
"Adding \"1\" to the \"Delay\" columns will cause the copter to momentarily "
"stop at each waypoint."
msgstr ""
"**WAYPOINT** - "
"设置足够多的航点，使飞行器以网格模式飞越拍摄区域。高度填写在「Alt」列，在「Delay」列填写「1」将使多旋翼在每个航点短暂悬停。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3d-mapping.rst:71 3ca439d025d847f9a4cc1bb119c11c2f
#: 65dc23bc8ac04735a88fdfb3474d989e 6b0c2b617f7c4e52b59b5373be771406
#: ae7861febf68416e8ead6ff25ab57f6e ddfbaf76b5a44a96bc7322f4851e24e0
msgid ""
"**DO_DIGICAM_CONTROL** will cause the camera shutter to be pushed once "
"immediately if the autopilot has been connected using a servo.  This command"
" takes no arguments and like other \"do\" commands it executes immediately "
"after the preceding waypoint command begins."
msgstr ""
"**DO_DIGICAM_CONTROL** "
"将在飞控通过舵机连接相机时立即触发一次快门。该指令无需参数，与其他「do」指令一样，在上一个航点指令开始后立即执行。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3d-mapping.rst:76 0aa68c0f9ac94b03aa39649ce914714d
#: 1b11cb559c6d42d5840c54dfddc5725a 1dacb8096ac64b3ab81e7211b249c93c
#: 1e569f162ca349d5851b43d4b8f11346 7f2502c705054b0a9341d89c1a23b325
msgid ""
"**DO_TRIGG_DISTANCE** is the same as do-digicam-control (above) except the "
"camera shutter will trigger every X meters.  Where X can be defined in the "
"first column labelled \"Dist (m)\"."
msgstr ""
"**DO_TRIGG_DISTANCE** 与 DO_DIGICAM_CONTROL（上述）相同，区别在于相机快门将每隔 X 米触发一次，其中 X "
"可在标注「Dist (m)」的第一列中定义。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3d-mapping.rst:80 3fdbf24410f94743b2d3c2912f2644ff
#: 48fe49c9f1f643d498b391e459f8eff4 51fca6776df441df82fcd55283af7c44
#: c9d17d3ed1be4118a1c710aa5ba762eb d0831fbf961c4fa19c96a2da8ad77474
msgid ""
"**RETURN_TO_LAUNCH** should be the last command in the mission so the "
"vehicles returns home."
msgstr "**RETURN_TO_LAUNCH** 应作为任务的最后一条指令，使飞行器返回 Home 点。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3d-mapping.rst:83 3af5ee426601422f82daac19edbfaf6a
#: 671835c064484535b07e7fb475ea2e5d a03d973a7e844b05ae4692447c639d19
#: b2ae42b8904a4cd4a6dffc487b30df82 b9360c7c2e0f4661bc6d500f30ca7622
msgid ""
"**DO_SET_ROI** can be used to point the nose of the vehicle and gimbal at a "
"specific point on the map."
msgstr "**DO_SET_ROI** 可用于使飞行器机头和云台指向地图上的特定点。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3d-mapping.rst:90 172c41e7ed324961b6331cd07fe3a9bc
#: 3fef3e01e5b442d583e17356b09663a4 65279302c20e4ce38a471399a927d45d
#: 8a7e33b4d36a4e4aaea832af34b1f4a7 9b31bb219df34269ae3a82e9f141f3b4
msgid "Recommended Desktop 3d mapping software"
msgstr "推荐的桌面 3D 建图软件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3d-mapping.rst:92 06eb1b12f803454d8c891ddf0e6d0707
#: 4349dafb4eb44d328ee53ea12392e4d3 4910066deb434cd3a715efc89056fcc0
#: b4a2160d48c14fd3b8a72f1d314762af baaa4aade4734f8d89898364cf36caca
msgid ""
"MicMac based toolchain together with (`ImageJ/Fiji <http://fiji.sc/>`__, "
"`QGIS <https://qgis.org/en/site/>`__, `SAGA GIS "
"<https://sourceforge.net/projects/saga-gis/>`__): open source and free!"
msgstr ""
"基于 MicMac 的工具链，配合 (`ImageJ/Fiji <http://fiji.sc/>`__、`QGIS "
"<https://qgis.org/en/site/>`__、`SAGA GIS "
"<https://sourceforge.net/projects/saga-gis/>`__)：开源免费！"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3d-mapping.rst:97 0c58d63cd0d74ee68274d26895a7974c
#: 6323f6addcf649969d20a4ce20477e8c 713696c6e9ef4f4fafc6738be62a6d33
#: 98c711b55efe46e485eb5020d41dfcac f8ad16c227b9427a84ec989fe8831ace
msgid "`VisualSFM <http://ccwu.me/vsfm/>`__ : free for non-commercial use"
msgstr "`VisualSFM <http://ccwu.me/vsfm/>`__：非商业用途免费"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3d-mapping.rst:99 0a497b8055e34d17b8c66ec689d9be12
#: 4b22cbb055dd491f83f9799f4c19ca28 5744b72047c743d48db3369325fb10b5
#: 9cbb828936fd442cb3ef4bff631a075b f68f3378c0ec4226b1f19bcd93800ee5
msgid ""
"`Agisoft Photscan <http://www.agisoft.com/>`__ : $179 for the standard "
"edition, $3,499 for the pro edition including georeferencing, orthopotos, "
"etc"
msgstr ""
"`Agisoft Photscan <http://www.agisoft.com/>`__：标准版 "
"$179，专业版（含地理参考、正射影像等）$3,499"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3d-mapping.rst:103
#: 72cde65f9b024c97a56b6e53c27f23c1 88be37afd609467bacec991d50bc7a1c
#: 88f140ec54e042109fc747270804bda2 cc4e5adf5c6542eda4ceeaf3dd328508
#: ff2120bc688346138c944e2e0416b9c8
msgid "`Pix4d <https://www.pix4d.com/>`__ : 6500 euros or 260 euros per month"
msgstr "`Pix4d <https://www.pix4d.com/>`__：6500 欧元或每月 260 欧元"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3d-mapping.rst:105
#: 2009292080f94d55a7d51a6c0a17417b 7547c55afac44447825fe0d3108f22c7
#: 7e37952cf72944bbba49d948c2eb3bd6 7e3f55d24afe431a8e88c7a045fd41fc
#: 96811abb70d34333b6dfb297f8ede51c
msgid ""
"`OpenDroneMap <https://opendronemap.org/>`__ : open source and free! (`user "
"intro video <https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=e2qp3o8caPs>`__)"
msgstr ""
"`OpenDroneMap <https://opendronemap.org/>`__：开源免费！（`用户入门视频 "
"<https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=e2qp3o8caPs>`__）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3d-mapping.rst:108
#: 11501dc76786456ba3841a5722a66866 2c4ac19a462c498b829cff756f4a1cc3
#: 46aff3a82b884e97b31a1da813a2097c c63c33ccad6e4372811a9f00199698e5
#: c72e27f388304a54ae275781ddcb7fff
msgid ""
"All of these software packages work in generally the same way in that they "
"consume the still images you've taken from the vehicle (and you may also "
"choose to add pictures taken by hand from the ground as well) and produce a "
"3d image (in what format?).  This is accomplished by automatically matching "
"up the images, it does not rely upon knowing the actual location from where "
"the image was taken."
msgstr ""
"上述所有软件的工作方式大体相同：将飞行器拍摄的静态图片（也可加入地面手拍照片）输入软件后，通过自动图像匹配生成 3D "
"图像，无需依赖图像拍摄时的实际位置信息。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3d-mapping.rst:116
#: 11e42a35f8d2476f8471b03037331547 643380c6d0cf4413b231287f742fb203
#: af32db0960a14fd8ada98c663fb89de0 c84e8415d54f421290006154d7a9101f
#: ce9c89424c6c42ed953999bd0bb8a664
msgid "Sharing your model"
msgstr "分享您的模型"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3d-mapping.rst:118
#: 7a0257a2f59c48d9bf0e1bafccef331f 90d8ae2b0bae4fe0b594ff9bc2e67dd9
#: bd42a402c184434695887397e1363121 cf94a26bcc094abe84e2598fc6569402
#: fd52d6f638fd4f03bd40b146eacf4413
msgid ""
"`Sketchfab <https://sketchfab.com/>`__ allows you to upload your completed "
"3d models so that others can interactively view the model in their web "
"browsers.  Click on the image at the top of the blog post to see an example."
msgstr ""
"`Sketchfab <https://sketchfab.com/>`__ 允许您上传完成的 3D "
"模型，让他人在浏览器中交互式浏览。点击博客顶部图片可查看示例。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3d-mapping.rst:123
#: 19023849517e4e788bceba6b3121c1da 84eaec6c504d4481993957dcb27a780b
#: b7256be374d1407c9acde0921fe2841b db82bafec9624f7fb2d779f4e58f7a93
#: f8df051e517c45ea8c2b098c733bf226
msgid ""
"`Three.js <http://threejs.org/>`__ allows you to provide 3D models on your "
"own webpage."
msgstr "`Three.js <http://threejs.org/>`__ 支持您在自己的网页上展示 3D 模型。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3d-mapping.rst:126
#: 36365063f43e4c319c53290cb82bc040 604899ec3e494321bcdecfee2a172c87
#: 868344a0dd02408e8cfe5206114dac47 882969e31a2049059662426fd6372947
#: 8854ba773cb24899b9b31a4f282c55e3
msgid ""
"`Blender <https://www.blender.org/>`__ can be used to create video files of "
"virtual fly throughs of the 3d model which can then be posted to YouTube.  "
"Here is an example by `Richard "
"<http://www.diydrones.com/profile/Richard721>`__."
msgstr ""
"`Blender <https://www.blender.org/>`__ 可用于制作 3D 模型虚拟穿越飞行的视频并发布到 YouTube。这里是 "
"`Richard <http://www.diydrones.com/profile/Richard721>`__ 制作的示例。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3d-mapping.rst:131
#: 2c8d9b3c15fb4c2092d7791b79b4b79e 714a742bea09450f8978e81a08eb7101
#: 721ea836cd9f4de685bd3d530e1c5a34 caa8f14fffc34f739624110297843a92
#: e664d83d620441acbac966755dd55906
msgid ""
"`Dronemapper <https://dronemapper.com/>`__ allows uploading and managing raw"
" images."
msgstr "`Dronemapper <https://dronemapper.com/>`__ 支持上传和管理原始图片。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3d-mapping.rst:138
#: 2993bc321c784f148ffdafdd84905fa4 401b391fed2d403a8986a087b5422eef
#: b7ec515a71de42ef9b84f2c9b9700ec0 c23ffb04d16d40c08400d716264749cc
#: f7bd59fbbbdd44569279b2b606d21ab4
msgid "Additional resources and Examples"
